Rem ==================================================================
Rem pure-core.shoddy — Part C proof fixture: a capability-free core
Rem (A3.3b), the common case for a library consumer. Declares one
Rem record type and three words over it, so a host can hand-build
Rem values, round-trip a record, and read fields back — with no
Rem machine dependencies, no effects, and nothing to grant. Its
Rem consumer's built output is the C1.3 dependency floor, asserted by
Rem test.
Rem ==================================================================

Type Sample
    Label As String
    Score As Number

Def SampleOf(tag As String, n As Number) As Sample
    Sample(tag, n)

Def Grade(s As Sample) As String
    If Score(s) >= 50 Then
        "PASS"
    Else
        "FAIL"

Def Scale(s As Sample, k As Number) As Sample
    With(s, Score = Score(s) * k)
